# Hermes engine runtime home (X2/U0 sync writes here)
data/engine/
# Top-level D:\Atlas\engine is the live Hermes home (config.yaml/logs/installs/
# auth.lock). Track only the two hand-authored Atlas artifacts: the persona
# prompt and the approval policy; the rest (caches, logs, installs, 349MB of
# machine-local runtime state) stays untracked.
/engine/*
!/engine/breaker.md
!/engine/config.yaml
.tmp/
data/*.sqlite
data/devices/

# H1 measurement junk (never commit)
**/pytest-temp/
# Whole artifacts/ tree is machine-local measurement output; tracked exceptions
